    "PhotoReference": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "病害对一张照片的引用，以及人工核对结论。\n\n`photo_number` 只是 Word 导入路的匹配键：Word 病害表的「照片编号」列和图片题注\n靠这个字符串对上，除它之外没有别的线索。来源软件导入没有这个概念——照片用外键\n直接绑在病害上（`images.ForeignKey`），所以编号为空，配对一律走\n`photo_candidate_id`。\n\n唯一的例外是 `pending` 和 `missing`：这两种状态下照片实体还不存在，\n`photo_candidate_id` 必为空，编号是这条引用仅有的标识，不能省。\n\n放宽为可空没有提高契约版本：5.0 下合法的文档现在依然合法，只是新文档允许省略\n该字段。升版会让库里已存的 5.0 草稿在重新打开时被拒。",
      "properties": {
        "photo_number": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Photo Number"
        },
        "resolution": {
          "enum": [
            "pending",
            "matched",
            "relinked",
            "missing",
            "unrelated"
          ],
          "title": "Resolution",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "photo_candidate_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Photo Candidate Id"
        },
        "resolved_defect_candidate_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Resolved Defect Candidate Id"
        },
        "review_note": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Review Note"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "resolution"
      ],
      "title": "PhotoReference",
      "type": "object"
    },
